## Commands used to produce paper figures

### Tabby cat (image 16763)

python dendrograms.py --model-a resnet50_timm --model-b swin_tiny --image-indices 16763  --top-k-classes 15

### Vizsla/moped (image 44101)

dendrograms.py --model-a vit_small_patch16_224 --model-b convnext_tiny --image-indices 44101 --top-k-classes 15 --soft-gt "vizsla:0.5,moped:0.5"
